Value PROTOCOL (Internet|Internet6)
Value IP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value AGE (\S+)
Value MAC ([0-9a-f\.]+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^Protocol\s+Address -> Header
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${IP}\s+${AGE}\s+${MAC}\s+${TYPE}\s+${INTERFACE}$$ -> Record

Header
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${IP}\s+${AGE}\s+${MAC}\s+${TYPE}\s+${INTERFACE}$$ -> Record
